        <title>原神月之七主线镜头赏析</title>
        <link>http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/</link>
        <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        
        <guid>http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/fm.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 原神月之七主线镜头赏析" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;非常喜欢原神这次的主线，任务流程、镜头调度、伏笔回收、群像描写、节奏把握都非常令人舒适！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;体验中喜欢的方面有：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;大群像，须弥主线全体角色和世界任务角色都有出场&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;节奏的把控、演出和分镜的精妙有代入感，沉浸感&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;剧情伏笔的回收，甚至包括曾经魔神任务、世界任务的回收都做得很好&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;为了让不熟悉前置世界任务和主线任务的旅行者能有更好的观看体验，引入了派蒙的笔记供随时查看&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;不过还有可以改进的方面，比如：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;战斗环节由于角色强度低，配队杂乱导致体验不好，可以多加点正面buff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;最后博士的boss战的战斗体验不是很丰富，可以多加些技能和机制，配合激烈的节奏，不过角色组合技方面很喜欢！&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我将选取几段进行赏析。截图取自b站泛音1572&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;身土坏空五蕴识转&#34;&gt;身土坏空，五蕴识转
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;这段的任务流程：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%83%E4%B8%BB%E7%BA%BF1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2400&#34;
	height=&#34;4260&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%83%E4%B8%BB%E7%BA%BF1_hu873480308456003340.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%83%E4%B8%BB%E7%BA%BF1_hu6644334271084790987.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;身土坏空，五蕴识转&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;56&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;135px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;首先通过柯莱的信件，引入任务。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;与赛索斯对话，发现大家身份都互换了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;然后依次与众人对话，把悬疑氛围推高，直到遇见提纳里。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这里的镜头很有感觉&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a1_hu11012407449851439003.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a1_hu15133348310848340427.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;1&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;首先用一个镜头的变焦，将视线转到柯莱身上，从提纳里视角出发，衔接上文，体现人物出场。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a2.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a2_hu2590421704834360975.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a2_hu1867460083568794983.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;2&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;经典的正反打。柯莱与提纳里的镜头远近不同，可能是想表示在玩家（柯莱）的眼里，现在的提纳里离自己认识的模样很远。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a3.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a3_hu4509502678236759212.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a3_hu7105733713155125075.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;3&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a4.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a4_hu11112527524144815655.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a4_hu5537212325738035720.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;4&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a5.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a5_hu15501851592036285277.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a5_hu185241176102867985.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;5&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;倾斜的镜头构图，表现出不安定感。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a5.5.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a5.5_hu12452850949496391013.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a5.5_hu18299367685370595816.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;5.5&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;人物走近并镜头跟随，体现柯莱迫切地想要向师父倾诉的心情。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a6.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a6_hu6656543464674840511.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a6_hu16768785029994265858.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;6&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;移动变焦，镜头拉远但焦距反方向变换使得主体不变，营造怪异、恐惧的氛围。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a7.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a7_hu14340441005425383914.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a7_hu9383715049791846819.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;7&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;俯视的视角，有种柯莱被压迫着的感觉，体现柯莱证明的无力。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a8.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a8_hu4507076553455897930.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a8_hu10715917714735551502.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;8&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a9.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a9_hu13267900351442458206.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a9_hu8080859063248891505.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;9&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;镜头的颤动加上移动变焦，体现柯莱内心恐惧感越来越深。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a10.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a10_hu3879761243365817693.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a10_hu8346565896396365148.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;10&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;正脸镜头加上移动变焦，让玩家看清柯莱流泪的表情，表现柯莱内心的恐惧不安。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a11.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a11_hu4743400157342662132.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a11_hu9023063691774764397.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;11&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;变焦，体现柯莱由于过于恐惧和眼泪的关系无法认真听师父的话语。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a12.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a12_hu190047931999177359.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a12_hu3481188326626700334.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;12&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a13.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a13_hu17819009933730087519.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a13_hu1570640975891126548.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;13&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;镜头的左右推加上不停变焦的模糊效果，配上角色的大喘气，体现出她的不愿相信、害怕，有种眩晕感。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a14.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a14_hu6914926417205702246.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a14_hu14888361740181308687.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;14&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;给脚步特写，体现柯莱的动作，想离开这里。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a15.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a15_hu6011838372896562655.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a15_hu7034064088270308290.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;15&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a16.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a16_hu8540613659885738065.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a16_hu1263983467385152292.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;16&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;倾斜的镜头，加上镜头后拉，和柯莱愈来愈喘不过气，体现她恐惧和想要逃离的心情。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a17.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a17_hu15712842651301756897.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a17_hu6179119773474539009.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;17&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;背后的镜头，会有从他人视角观察主体的感觉，这里想表达柯莱的孤独、极度的悲伤与恐惧。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a18.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a18_hu11414677871439788620.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a18_hu6956500285841052965.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;18&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a19.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a19_hu2956187767315020417.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a19_hu9090598198012845515.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;19&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;特写柯莱捂脸的画面，在节奏到达最高潮时，提纳里声音先出现，然后黑屏转场。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a20.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a20_hu5843298076163831002.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a20_hu6391706235230687715.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;20&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;快速变焦推远，有从梦里惊醒的感觉。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a21.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2169&#34;
	height=&#34;1220&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a21_hu5070207261985964082.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/a21_hu17845796322847974188.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;21&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;移动镜头，提纳里走来，聚焦人物出场并体现空间关系。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;找来旅行者帮助后，须弥几乎已经搬迁至沙漠。旅行者与须弥的伙伴共同商讨策略。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这段和下段任务做的很好的一点就是各个角色各司其职，条理清晰。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;比如卡维、艾尔海森忙于重建虚空，旅行者、纳西妲前去寻求火神之心等。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;虚空劫灰往世书&#34;&gt;虚空劫灰往世书
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;这里最让人印象深刻的莫过于世界树破土而出后，浮现任务面板，原来的“道成千壑，因果异灭”被火焰灼烧，烧出任务真正的名字“虚空劫灰往世书”。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;首先是世界树第一次暴露在地表，其次“虚空劫灰往世书”这个名字从开服的足迹pv，一直埋伏笔埋了六年，玩家激动之心难以言表。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;剧情梗概如下：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/genshin1/%E5%89%A7%E6%83%85%E6%A2%97%E6%A6%82.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2302&#34;
